{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":61384,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793462755024,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2012,"episodeCount":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iSCkJG5Bkd2r0VGppM1SwvMVqYN.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1009828","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Jin Kanzaki is poor, but he lives a happy life with his grandfather. Together with his friends Kouga and Konoha, he helps out people for a fee. Meanwhile, the police are searching for a vicious serial killer.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-04-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pqKZFltvsMoTqUBY8mJtuzHoEHB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pqKZFltvsMoTqUBY8mJtuzHoEHB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1009829","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A few years have passed since Jin went missing. Kouga, still dreaming of becoming a real hero, is intent on catching a serial arsonist prowling the streets.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-04-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2FUEGvjZHQF3ohA7XzTQUNWAQzr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2FUEGvjZHQF3ohA7XzTQUNWAQzr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1009830","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Jin wakes up, he sees a monster holding the lifeless body of his foster mother, Akemi. An old man named Mitsugai is attempting to awaken ZET within Jin by using her. Mitsugai succeeds and ZET awakens...but he's still incomplete.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-04-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j2uKkVJUr9Wg3HdO9cojx17PP7K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j2uKkVJUr9Wg3HdO9cojx17PP7K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1009831","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Two years have passed. Players are wreaking havoc in society, but humans are still unaware of their existence. People live in fear, and Mitsugai is unable to produce another ZET.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kRPbXLarUNMnHVWUBxXsWuP5k8N.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRPbXLarUNMnHVWUBxXsWuP5k8N.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1009832","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kouga tries to become a superhero by creating a real-life Alphas. A mysterious man approaches him with a test to see if he's qualified to become one.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zJBkPdwNIL85dwr7KIkl55XUNIy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zJBkPdwNIL85dwr7KIkl55XUNIy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1009833","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Konoha is taken hostage and Jin is unable to do anything. Unlike before, he cannot become ZET by hurting himself and doesn't have his Activation Gum.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7etMHGKO44fTl2NKYZ2i7Bbu1Wy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7etMHGKO44fTl2NKYZ2i7Bbu1Wy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1009834","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ZET finally turns red and displays powers unlike anything seen before. With overwhelming strength, ZET dominates the fight against a Player. Meanwhile, Kouga is having a tough time fending off a Player in his first battle as Alphas.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m8Bfd6whN7XxjU2RFpykWU1ZQNo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m8Bfd6whN7XxjU2RFpykWU1ZQNo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1009835","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kouga learns that Jin has been fighting by himself as ZET. Thrilled over meeting a true hero, Kouga calls him \"ZETMAN\" and declares he will fight alongside him. Jin and Kouga head for the lab to find out why Red ZET turned white.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AaWWraApAj9Prqhfa1EVpEvZWvR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AaWWraApAj9Prqhfa1EVpEvZWvR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1009836","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The key to completing ZET is the pendant that Konoha has in her possession. Haitani and his men easily infiltrate the Amagi residence. Konoha wakes up and finds Jin standing in front of her. She hands him the pendant, not knowing he's actually a clone.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xc16Ncb3fvgWdVXcwGahJ6R8CDc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xc16Ncb3fvgWdVXcwGahJ6R8CDc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1009837","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Konoha goes missing. Kouga receives a phone call from the man who gave him the first test where he had to choose between the lives of his sister or three high school girls he didn't know. Kouga chose Konoha and the girls were killed.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8BXukI4H89GsNSngMsfw2KAUSG0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8BXukI4H89GsNSngMsfw2KAUSG0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1009838","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haitani hijacks a broadcast signal in Middletown to declare war against humanity. Under his leadership, regressed Players start wreaking havoc, but Jin appears as ZET to protect people and fights as a one-man army.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/poNeBVXaM5ICEh5w2jFqbtMDn6Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/poNeBVXaM5ICEh5w2jFqbtMDn6Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61384/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1009839